{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["Incense is often used in witchcraft. What is the meaning of jasmine scented incense?","Luck in love"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"religion-faith\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
