{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["It is the magical power of this herb: In the event of some kind of troublesome misfortune, gather the root with care during the descent of the lions cub and hang it around your neck. It will drive away cares and cause a merry heart. - Syrenius (1540 - 1611).","Angelica"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"religion-faith\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["An ancient tradition was to distinguish witches by their color. There were white, red, green, etc. witches. The tradition doesnt exist any more but the meaning of the colors is still applied in various practices. What is the color for these magical uses: divination, spirituality, protection, psychic powers, healing, truth, peace?","White"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"religion-faith\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
