{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["This ancient pagan ritual was practiced in Scotland until the end of the 19th century. It allows a couple to make a commitment to each other within their own spiritual path. This commitment lasts for one year and a day. After that the couple can go their own way or renew their bond.","Handfasting"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"religion-faith\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
